      "beat_id": "BIDEA",
      "act": "THE IDEA",
      "lane": "IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here's the idea of this film. You can grade the code, but any AI can generate any code — so grading the code from the AI era measures the AI, not the student. What you can grade is the CLAUDE dot m d: the file the student writes before Claude touches anything, and the dated entries they add when Claude got confidently wrong. The code came from Claude. The file came from the student. The file is the assessment.",
